# owner: project maintainer
# date: 2026-03-23
# purpose: production-oriented environment example scaffold for Curatarr
# docs: README.md, maintainer/README.md
# deployment notes:
#   - Pin PROJECT_IMAGE to a built or published Curatarr image tag when releases exist.
#   - Provide a real config.yaml outside Git and point PROJECT_CONFIG_FILE at it.
# history:
#   - 2026-03-10: Initialized generic template example.
#   - 2026-03-23: Adapted the example for Searcharr-nxg.
#   - 2026-04-29: Reset to Curatarr scaffold baseline.

# Container image pinned for deployment.
PROJECT_IMAGE=ghcr.io/brainponders/curatarr:dev-local

# Container identity.
PROJECT_CONTAINER_NAME=curatarr
PROJECT_CONFIG_FILE=./config.yaml
